Lyone.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Watch Captain]] of the [[Deathwatch]], serving with [[Watch Fortress]] [[Null Breach]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
Prior to his secondment, Lyone was a [[Primaris]] [[Intercessor]] of the [[Novamarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}}

He aided the [[Kill-Team]]s led by [[Watch Captain]] [[Daxis]] in their battles against the [[Ork]]s of [[Calverna]] and within six months of joining the Deathwatch, he became fearfully known to the Orks as '''Da Black Butcha''', while his [[Battle Brother]]s began to call him '''Orksbane'''. When Watch Captain Daxis was later killed in battle by a rampaging [[Squiggoth]], Lyone single-handily killed the massive creature with pinpoint fire. This earned him Daxis's former command and Lyone has excelled as a Watch Captain ever since.{{Fn|1}}

