M'yen'j'kaara.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
'''Shas'O Vash'ya M'yen'j'kaara''' is a [[Vash'ya]] [[Sept]] [[Tau Commander|Commander]] in the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} its [[Third Sphere of Expansion]] forces{{Fn|2}} that invaded the [[Imperial]] [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]].{{Fn|3}} M'yen'j'kaara would use unorthodox tactics during the invasion and was responsible for overtaking many Imperial worlds.{{Fn|1}} However the [[T'au Empire]] were then targeted by the Imperium in the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Mont'shi Campaign]]{{Fn|3}} and the [[Tau Commander|Commander]] was made a '''Threat Level Primary'''. M'yen'j'kaara was then wanted dead for his actions, as it was believed this would prove the Imperium's superiority to the T'au.{{Fn|1}} However the Mont'shi Campaign eventually ended in failure for the Imperium{{Fn|3}} and M'yen'j'kaara survived the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}
