Macex.wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
'''Macex''' was a [[Lexicanium]]{{Fn|1b}} in the [[Raptors (Chapter)|Raptors]] [[Chapter]]'s [[5th Company (Raptors)|Fifth Company]] serving under [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Mito]]. When the Fifth Company was stationed aboard the [[Emperor Class Battleship]] ''[[Enduring Blade]]''{{Fn|1b}}, the ship received a request of aid from [[Meyloch Severus]], the [[Planetary Governor]] of [[Dolumar IV]], as it was being attacked by the [[Tau]].{{Fn|1a}} The ''Enduring Blade'' and [[Battlefleet Ultima Primus]] (as well as Macex and his company) travelled to Dolumar IV, where they engaged the Tau warship [[Or'es Tash'var]], which had the recently freed [[Ethereal]] [[Ko'vash]] aboard it.{{Fn|1b}}

Captain Mito's Company had captured the Ethereal earlier and delivered him to Dolumar IV{{Fn|1b}} so when the Or'es Tash'var war boarded, Macex was part of a squad sent to recapture him.{{Fn|1b}} As [[Storm Troopers]] boarded the warship in [[Shark Assault Boat|assault ships]]{{Fn|1b}}, Macex's squad [[teleportation|teleported]] directly onto its bridge, where they quickly killed its crew save for its Captain [[O'T'yra]]. O'T'yra was tortured by Macex's squad in order to learn the location of Ko'vash aboard the ship, but he refused to tell them. Running out of patience, Macex used his [[psychic]] powers to forcefully search O'T'yra’s mind for the information. Macex almost succeeded, when the [[Fire Warrior]] [[La'Kais]] stormed the bridge and shot him in the face, killing him instantly.{{Fn|1b}}

