Maehekta.wikitext:
{{ThousandSonsPortal}}
'''Maehekta''' is a [[Blank]] that serves [[Ahriman]]'s [[Exiles]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]].{{Fn|1a}} 
==History==
She was originally a member of the [[Curators (Warband)|Curators]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]], that was based in the [[Eye of Terror]]. Its members were obsessed with obtaining secrets and were very successful in using various methods to do so. However other leaders in the Eye became fearful of what the Curators knew of them and this led to the Warband being destroyed. However Maehekta survived the Curators' purge and hid the fact that she was one of its members. The [[Blank]] would later reveal herself to the [[Sorcerer]] [[Ahriman]], though, and offered her aid in helping his [[Exiles]] Warband, find a cure to the [[Pyrodomon]] that was destroying them.{{Fn|1b}} 

Her status as a [[Blank]], though, greatly unnerves the [[Exiles]]' [[Sorcerers]]. They are repulsed by Maehekta's presence and move away from her, if she nears their location. The Sorcerer [[Ignis]] even threateningly warned the Blank to keep away from him, which Maehekta calmly accepted and complied with. Only [[Ahriman]] seems able to withstand being near her and even he must steady his mind to do so{{Fn|1a}}. While [[Ahriman]] knows of her past, the rest of the Exiles do not know of her past as a member of the [[Curators (Warband)|Curators]]. She would reveal this to the Sorcerer [[Ctesias]], who was surprised that a Curator had survived the [[Chaos Warband|Warband]]'s purge. Afterwards, though, he could not help but wonder, what Ahriman had promised in exchange for Maehekta's aid.{{Fn|1b}}

