Magmus.wikitext:
{{SalamandersPortal}}
'''Magmus''' is a [[Salamanders]] [[Terminator]], who wields a [[Heavy Flamer]] as he has a love of fire, like much of his [[Chapter]] does.{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
In [[M42]], he was among the [[Salamanders]]{{Fn|1b}} that defended the [[Imperium]]'s worlds in the [[Vertex Sector]]. When the vital world of [[Vertex (World)|Vertex]], suffered an [[Ork]] invasion{{Fn|1a}} the Salamanders{{Fn|1b}} and several [[Space Marine Chapter]]s came to its defense{{Fn|1a}}. Magmus would do battle with the invading Orks and the Salamanders would make many great sacrifices in defending the world. Because of this, Vertex's grateful population now greets the Chapter with cheers, whenever their [[Power Armor]] or the Salamanders' symbol is seen{{Fn|1b}}. Magmus' mission would later change, though, when the [[Xenos]] found a weakness in the [[Hive City]] of '''Acastus'''' defenses. It had been protected during the invasion by a [[Void Shield|Void Shield network]], which was projected from an armored bunker designated '''Shield Generator Gamma-9'''. However the Orks would discover this and several hordes were sent to destroy it, so the Xenos could invade the Hive City.{{Fn|1a}} 

The [[Chapter]]s became aware of the danger{{Fn|1a}} and each sent a [[Terminator]] to protect the [[Void Shield|Shield Generator]]. Magmus was sent by the [[Salamanders]] to defend it and he was joined by the [[Blood Angel]] [[Terminator Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Angelus (Blood Angels)|Angelus]], the [[Imperial Fist]] [[Etrus]], the [[Space Wolf]] [[Stormheart]] and the [[Ultramarine]] [[Lucian (Ultramarines)|Lucian]]{{Fn|1b}}. Though they numbered only five, in the close confines of the armored bunker, these Terminator-armored warriors would be in their element. None would allow the Orks access to '''Shield Generator Gamma-9''', without a fierce battle.{{Fn|1a}} 

==Sources==
