Mal'Caor.wikitext:
{{TauPortal}}
'''Mal'Caor, the Spider''', is a [[Tau Commander|Commander]] in the [[T'au Empire]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} its [[Third Sphere of Expansion]] forces{{Fn|2}} that invaded the [[Imperial]] [[Sector]]s near the [[Damocles Gulf]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the Imperium later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Mont'shi Campaign]] against the [[T'au Empire]]{{Fn|3}} and the [[Tau Commander|Commander]] was made a priority target. During the conflict, Mal'Caor's forces were a plague upon Imperial worlds, but they were difficult to destroy, as the Spider refused to fight on open ground. Instead, Mal'Caor preferred to lurk in the shadows and then launch attacks upon a world's population. Though the Imperium believes the Commander was later killed by its forces, this has not been confirmed.{{Fn|1}} 
