'''Malphas''' was a [[Black Templars]] [[Chaplain]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
In his four hundred years of service to his [[Chapter]], Malphas has seen many good deeds as well as acts of [[Heresy]]. The [[Chaplain]] saw such acts with the [[T'au Empire]], who claimed to be peaceful yet slaughtered anyone who did not join [[Greater Good|them]]. Malphas would make it his mission to prove the [[Xenos]] were wolves in sheep's clothing and launched a [[Crusade]] against the T'au. None of the Xenos were safe from his wrath and the Chaplain's Crusade forces continued his war against the T'au Empire, as part{{Fn|1}} of the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s{{Fn|2}} [[Mont'shi Campaign]].{{Fn|3}} However Malphas would later die in battle with the T'au and it is not known what became of his Crusade forces afterwards.{{Fn|1}}
