Maltius Othram.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Maltius Othram''' is a [[General]] of the [[Imperial Guard]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
Of humble origins, Maltius was once a serf from [[Sepheris Secundus]] in the [[Calixis Sector]]. However he was conscripted by the [[Feudal World]] to serve in the [[Margin Crusade]], where his battle prowess and shrewd tactical skills allowed him to gain the favor of a number of influential commanders and nobles, eventually gaining him a position in the [[Achilus Crusade]] under [[Lord Commander]] [[Ebongrave]]. Many, however, are resentful and disdainful of his menial origins, and some suspect his appointment under Ebongrave may have been a calculated move by his rivals. But contrary to his rivals' expectations, Othram has come to idolize Ebongrave and believes the Imperial war effort in the [[Canis Salient]] would be doomed without him.{{Fn|1}}

Othram has always placed a great value on the lives of the men under his command, giving him respect from the rank-and-file [[Guardsman]] of the Crusade, but earning him the nickname "Soft Othram" among his peers.{{Fn|1}}

