Malum Caedo.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
[[File:MalumCaedo.png|right|thumbnail|Malum Caedo on Graia]]
'''Malum Caedo''' is a [[Sternguard Veteran]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1}} 

==Biography==
After the invasion of [[Orks]] and [[Daemon|Chaos daemons]], the [[Forge World]] of [[Graia]] was kept under close watch by the [[Inquisition]]. After rogue [[techpriest]]s experimented with the remains of [[Inquisitor]] [[Drogan]]'s power source, a [[warp rift]] was opened on the planet leading to a [[Chaos]] invasion. In response to this, Inquisitor [[Seibel]] of the [[Ordo Malleus]] requested the deployment of an Ultramarines Sternguard Veteran squad to secure the power source.

During their deployment, their [[drop pod]] was hit by enemy fire and crash landed, leaving Malum Caedo as the sole survivor. Guided by a [[servo skull]], he ventured into battle against [[cultist]]s, [[Chaos Space Marines]] and Daemons to recover the power source.{{Fn|2}}

==Quotes==
Some notable quotes of Malum Caedo include:

"The Emperor demands your life!" {{Fn|3}}

"I care not if this planet stands, so long as you die!" {{Fn|3}}

"Your death is my glory!" {{Fn|3}}

"The Emperor sent me to redeem you! In holy fire!" {{Fn|3}}

"The Emperor's hands will touch you and you will not survive!" {{Fn|3}}

"Beg your gods for mercy! I have none!" {{Fn|3}}

"Hail to the Emperor, heretic!" {{Fn|3}}

"You cannot escape the reach of my hatred!" {{Fn|3}}

"I have learned this from Calgar himself!" {{Fn|3}}

"Death is the reward for heresy!" {{Fn|3}}

"I will finish the work Captain Titus started!" {{Fn|3}}

"Sidonus laid down his life for this planet! I will protect his sacrifice!" {{Fn|3}}

"I am the executioner of the Emperor!" {{Fn|3}}

"I am the edge of his blade!" {{Fn|3}}

"I purge, again!" {{Fn|3}}

"I am your doom!" {{Fn|3}}

"Forget nothing, forgive no-one!" {{Fn|3}}

"My sword is hatred!" {{Fn|3}}

"My shield is disgust!" {{Fn|3}}

"My armor is contempt!" {{Fn|3}}

"My love for the Imperium is matched only by my hatred of the heretic!" {{Fn|3}}

