Malvolion (General).wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Malvolion''' is an [[Astra Militarum]] [[General]], who is taking part in the [[Fourth Tyrannic War]] [[Battle of Bastior|defense]] of the [[Bastior Sub-sector]].{{Fn|1}} 
==Biography==
Malvolion is amongst an advisory group of the keenest military minds in the [[Bastior Sub-sector]], who are aiding the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter Master]] [[Calgar]]'s strategic efforts to defeat the invading [[Tyranids]]. If need be, though, Calgar will dispatch members of the group to lead military operations. Such was the case, when Malvolion was ordered to command a relief force to [[Avarax]]. The embattled [[Recidious System]] [[Hive World]] had not only been invaded by the Tyranids, but also the [[Thousand Sons]] [[Traitor Legion]]. Though the Ultramarines' [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|Second Company]] had repelled the [[Chaos Space Marines]], the [[Xenos]] still remained on Avarax in significant numbers. Once he arrived there, Malvolion was to aid the remnants of the [[Cadian 8th]] and the in-coming [[Mars]] [[Adeptus Mechanicus]] forces, with defending the Hive World from the Tyranids. The Imperium count not afford to lose Avarax, if its efforts to purge the Xenos from the Recidious System, was to be successful.{{Fn|1}}

