Mar Av Ashariel.wikitext:
{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Mar Av Ashariel''' became the [[Lord Commander Militant]] and a [[High Lord of Terra]], following the [[Senatorum Imperialis]] edicts declared by [[Lord Commander]] [[Roboute Guilliman]].{{Fn|1}}

Ashariel is known for his tactical brilliance and had served as a member of the [[Catharti Arraigners]], one of the fabled [[Old Hundred]] of [[Terra]]. He accepted his new position, though, as [[Guilliman]] was a worthy leader and the [[Lord Commander]]'s [[Indomitus Crusade]] would finally go on the offensive against the [[Imperium]]'s enemies. Shortly after Ashariel became a [[High Lord]], he was visited by the [[Chancellor of the Imperial Council]] [[Anna-Murza Jek]], who wished to aid him in anything he needed in his new position. She also requested that Ashariel bring additional [[Astra Militarum]] forces to Terra, which was still rocked by the aftereffects of the [[Great Rift]]'s creation. The Lord Militant refused, however, as he would not take resources from the Crusade or any other world in this desperate moment in the Imperium's history. Ashariel ended the visit by telling Jek that Terra would have to depend on its current forces to safeguard against the world's internal turmoil. He was now concerned with the fates of a million other worlds and Terra was the least among them.{{Fn|1}}

He ultimately joined [[Irthu Haemotalion]]'s [[Hexarchy]] against Guilliman, but was slain by [[Callidus Assassin]]s of [[Fadix]] when the coup unraveled.{{Fn|2}}

