Marcus Heilbron.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinesPortal}}
'''Marcus Heilbron''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] in the [[Black Crusaders]] [[Chapter]] who took part in the invasion of the [[Ork World]] [[Guilus II]].{{Fn|1}}  
==History==
During the invasion, Heilbron led his [[Space Marine Company|Company]] and [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiments]] of the [[Astra Militarum]] in attacking one of the [[Ork]] enclaves on the world - a '''Grot Town'''.  True to its name, the majority of the Ork enclave were [[Gretchin]], who proved to be no match for Heilbron's forces.  However, under the guidance of their [[Mekboy]]z, the Gretchin came up with several fiendish defences; among them being the creation of the [[Grot Bomb Launcha]]s.  At the height of the battle for Grot Town, the Launchas made their presence known when they fired a salvo of [[Grot Bomb]]s at the armoured convoy Heilbron was leading from his [[Land Raider]].  The Captain was subsequently killed when several of the Grot Bombs struck and disabled his Land Raider.{{Fn|1}}

