Markan Hrotham.wikitext:
{{ChaosKnightsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a Lord of [[House Makabius]] during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

Originally a [[Freeblade]] who left his House to fight in the [[Great Crusade]], Markan gained a high reputation and the favor of [[Ezekyle Abaddon]] after helping the [[Luna Wolves]] defeat ancient artificial lifeforms in an abandoned forge-crypt. Markan grew close to Abaddon and the [[Luna Wolves]]. Shortly before the [[Drop Site Massacre]] Markan returned to his homeworld of [[Baroda]] with a message from [[Horus]] promising glory to the world if they join his rebellion. The ruling Lords of Baroda refused, but with the aid of younger glory-hungry [[Knight]] pilots Markan was able to launch a coup and take control of the planet. Soon after, he launched a purge against loyalist elements of the planet. During the Heresy, he became a member of [[Mortarion]]'s inner circle.{{Fn|1}}

