Markog.wikitext:
{{SlaaneshPortal}}
'''Markog''' is the [[Chaos Lord]] of the [[Dolorous Guard]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]], which serves as the [[Chaos Space Marine Honour Guard|bodyguards]] for the [[Ten Thousand Eyes]]' master, [[Seraphax]].{{Fn|1a}}
==History==
Markog was originally a prideful officer in the '''Ashen Blades''' [[Chapter]]. When his fleet became trapped by a [[Warp Storm]], Chapter-wide infighting occurred, and by the time the survivors had freed themselves{{Fn|1b}} they had become corrupted by the forces of [[Chaos]]{{Fn|1a}}. Markog emerged from this conflict as not only the commander of the [[Blade of Truth]] [[Battle Barge]], but also a worshiper of [[Slaanesh]], likely due to his pride. From the ruins of the Ashen Blades, he formed{{Fn|1b}} the [[Dolorous Guard]], who would later ally with the [[Ten Thousand Eyes]]. The Guard is now the [[Chaos Space Marine Honour Guard|bodyguards]] of the warhost's master, [[Seraphax]], and Markog reverently obeys his every command. The [[Chaos Lord]] is very suited for his role{{Fn|1a}}, as Markog's worship of Slaanesh has granted him{{Fn|1b}} the [[Daemon Axe]] [[Heartdrinker]]{{Fn|1a}}. As long as he holds the weapon{{Fn|1d}}, Markog is able to heal from any wound {{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1c}}, and can also teleport the [[Dolorous Guard]] where need be{{Fn|1d}}. However, he has been left with a strong desire to consume [[Human]] flesh, especially that of [[Space Marines]].{{Fn|1a}}

During the battle between the Ten Thousand Eyes and the returned [[Lion El'Jonson]] and his [[The Risen|loyalist Fallen Angels]], Markog was slain by a group of Risen including [[Guain]], [[Borz]], [[Zabriel]], [[Galad]], and [[Launciel]].{{Fn|1d}}

