Marquis Vaulkhere.wikitext:
{{DrukhariPortal}}
'''Marquis Vaulkhere''' is the current wearer of the Ironthorn Crown, making him [[Archon]] of the [[Kabal of the Lords of Iron Thorn]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
A towering and bombastic individual, Marquis prides himself on his heritage and sophistication.  However, beneath this aura of faded grandeur lies a bloodthirsty soul looking for any excuse to kill.{{Fn|1}}

Vaulkhere was manipulated by [[Asdrubael Vect]] into combating the [[Ynnari]] after the Supreme Overlord sent subtle whispers that his hated rivals, the [[Kabal of Poisoned Hope]], had converted to [[Yvraine]]'s cause. Seeing a chance to eliminate his rivals, Vaulkhere sent forces against the Poisoned Hopes fortress, the Howling Spire. After fighting through Ynnari and Dark Eldar forces alike, Vaulkhere was able to slay [[Leshh]], Archon of the Poisoned Hope. His forces were successful in annihilating the Ynnari of the Howling Spire.{{Fn|2}}

