{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Marvek Kolovas''' was a technician and officer who worked on the [[Lucifus Platform]] on [[Armageddon]].{{Fn|1}}

During the [[Third War for Armageddon]], the [[Valdez Oil Platforms]] were attacked by a wave of [[Ork Submersible]]s. Kolovas was the only platform worker who was able to send a distress signal to the nearby [[Hive Helsreach]]. Although Kolovas died, along with the other labourers on the platforms, his message warned Helsreach of the impending attack, allowing them to muster forces to defend the southern docks.{{Fn|1}}

