Mascios.wikitext:
{{ScythesOfTheEmperorPortal}}
'''Brother Mascios''' was [[Space Marine]] in the [[Scythes of the Emperor]] [[Chapter]], shortly before the fall of [[Sotha]]. He was a member of [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Hekaton (Sergeant)|Hekaton]]'s [[Tactical Squad]], and bore his name upon his pauldron.{{Fn|1}}

Mascios was part of the crusade to liberate the reliquary world of [[Egottha]] in '''990.[[M41]]''', travelling aboard the ''[[Xenophon]]''.{{Fn|1}}

When the ship was attacked by [[Tyranid]] forces, Mascios was assigned to accompany [[Space Marine Sergeant|Serf-sergeant]] [[Milus Ogden]] and his fellow security officers in the procurement of weaponry and equipment from the ship's stores. He saved Ogden's life when the vessel was struck by debris, and later formed an almost paternal bond with the serf.{{Fn|1}}

Later, after almost single-handedly destroying a Tyranid [[Kraken (Bio-Ship)#Ramsmiter|Ramsmiter]], Mascios was killed while attempting to repel a xenos boarding party.{{Fn|1}}

