Masimat Helicos.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Masimat Helicos''' was the [[Lord Sector|Lord Sector Designate]] of the [[Jericho Sector]], after the end of the [[Age of Apostasy]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
As the ship carrying Helicos traveled in the [[Warp]] to reach the [[Sector]], however, it was struck by a violent [[Warp Storm]]. This caused Helicos' ship to disappear before it reached [[Jericho Sector|Jericho]] and marked the beginning of the Sector's darkest days. Soon afterwards, the [[Warp Storm]]s on the edge of Jericho's region became more violent and more frequent. This eventually caused the Sector to become isolated from the [[Imperium]].{{Fn|1}}

