Maugra Vaskadeen.wikitext:
{{DrukhariPortal}}

{{QuoteBox
|quote = '''''"Ah, but we are among outsiders, let us be courteous and speak such that they will understand. Greetings. I am Hekatrix Maugra Vaskadeen. I understand you are to be my stalwart comrades, so you may call me simply Maugra."'''''{{Fn|1a}}
|}}

'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a solitary [[Dark Eldar]] [[Wych|Hekatrix]].{{Fn|1a}} She had battled in alien arenas for centuries prior to her arrival at the [[Precipice]].{{Fn|1c}} She was part of a small group of adventurers seeking a cure from the [[Seventh Blackstone Fortress|Seventh]] [[Blackstone Fortress]] to a psychic plague rampaging through the Precipice, and had been hired by [[the Echo]] for her formidable combat prowess.{{Fn|1a}}

==Personality==
Maugra was gleefully tolerant striking occasional companionships with [[Asuryani]] and even non-[[Aeldari]] for journeys into the Blackstone Fortress so long as she got into exciting action, for she was quickly bored without it. She enjoyed toying and playing with others, companions and foes alike, but had little tolerance for anyone trying to disturb her during fights, and would threaten and question those who did so.{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}{{Fn|1c}}

==Wargear==
As her weapons Maugra wore a pair of obsidian coloured [[Hydra Gauntlet|Hydra Gauntlets]]{{Fn|1a}}, and carried elaborately decorated syringes that were loaded with [[Combat Drugs|combat drugs]] to enhance her performance in combat.{{Fn|1c}} She wore a black [[Wychsuit|wychsuit]] reinforced with layers of sharply serrated armour.{{Fn|1a}}

