Maur Saim-Ingrelli.wikitext:
[[Image:MaurBT.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1a}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the current ruling [[Eldar]] [[Striking Scorpions]] [[Exarch]] of the [[Onyx Claw Shrine]].{{Fn|1b}}

Hailing from [[Biel-Tan]], he had trodden the [[Eldar Path|Path of the Teller]] and [[Eldar Path|Path of the Weaver]] before settling into the [[Path of the Warrior]]. As a warrior, he has  served both in the [[Shadow Spectre]]s and [[Fire Dragon]]s and sought to become an [[Autarch]] one day. However after his Striking Scorpions sister was slain battling [[Daemon]]s, Maur came to the Onyx Claw Shrine and became consumed by an Aspect of Khaine. Fanatically practicing and training, his obsession saw him lost into becoming an [[Exarch]].{{Fn|1}}

As Exarch of the Onyx Claw, Maur has become known as one of the hardest warriors on Biel-Tan who demands much from those under his command. However he has nonetheless created many great warriors, and many wish to train under his notoriously brutal tutelage. He has overseen a number of victories for the Shrine, including assassinating a [[Ork]] [[Warboss]] on [[Ler'sioth]] and taking part in a cleansing of [[Leagues of Votann]] [[Squat]]s on the [[Exodite World]] of [[Heresa'lil]]. Currently, he is leading an expedition to the ruins of [[Bheta-Decima]] to rescue the [[Farseer]] [[Torc Dystari]]. During the mission, he came into battle with [[Raven Guard]] [[Scout]]s under [[Kyrin Torvaec]].{{Fn|1b}}

