Maurtear.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Maurtear''' is an [[Asuryani]] [[Exarch]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He was among{{Fn|1}} the species' forces that invaded the [[Chinchare sub-sector]], in the wake of the [[13th Black Crusade]]. However the [[Imperium]] later launched the [[Dark Crusade (Imperium)|Dark Crusade]]'s [[Kith Campaign]] against the invading [[Asuryani]]{{Fn|2}} and Maurtear was made one of its priority targets. He became known as the '''Scourge of the Burnicus Subsector''' and a champion for his species, after the [[Exarch]] raided many of the Imperial [[Colony World|colonies]], [[Munitorum]] storehouses and other vulnerable targets within the [[Bunicus Subsector]]. This led him to be declared '''Xenos Purgatus''' by the legendary [[Inquisitor]] [[Alexander Mane]] and no effort was spared to track down and kill Maurtear and his warriors.{{Fn|1}} However while the Asuryani were eventually defeated by the Imperium's forces,{{Fn|2}} Maurtear survived the conflict.{{Fn|1}}
==Trivia==
