''Maurtear'', [[Alexander Mane]] and the [[Burnicus Subsector]] were created for the [[Dark Crusade Campaign]] by the '''Hobby Center''' staff of [[Games Workshop]]'s '''Glen Burnie HQ''' store{{Fn|1}} in '''Glen Burnie, Maryland, USA'''.{{Fn|3}}

