Maxima Atavian.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Maxima Atavian'''{{Fn|4}} is a [[Space Marine Sergeant]] from the [[Ultramarines]] [[2nd Company (Ultramarines)|2nd Company]], under [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Cato Sicarius]]. He commands one of the two [[Devastator Squad]]s assigned to the 2nd Company.{{Fn|1a}}

==Biography==
His squad, nicknamed "The [[Titan]] Slayers" was awarded the [[Principex Maxima]] for their destruction of the [[Chaos Warlord Titan|Renegade Warlord Titan]] ''[[Soulmauler]]''.{{Fn|1a}}

===Black Reach===
During the [[Assault on Black Reach]] in 855 [[M41]]{{Fn|1b}}, Squad Tirian were deployed to [[Black Reach]] with the rest of the Second Company against [[Waaagh! Zanzag]]. After the liberation of [[Ghospora Hive]] from the [[ork]]s, the Titan Slayers accompanied Sicarius and the rest of the company to hunt down [[Warboss]] [[Zanzag]].{{Fn|2b}}

===Espandor===
During the attack of the [[Bloodborn]] on [[Ultramar]], in 854999.M41{{Fn|1b}}, the 2nd Company was deployed to [[Espandor]].{{Fn|3}}

===Indomitus Crusade===
When the Second Company left from Terra Atavian and his [[Devastator Squad]]s were onboard a different ship than most of the company. As a result, unlike most of Second Company, he avoided being lost in the warp aboard the ''[[Emperor's Will (Strike Cruiser)|Emperor's Will]]''.{{Fn|5}} Atavian and the Titan Slayers would continue to serve in Second Company under the command of [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Acheran]].{{Fn|6}} 

==Appearance==
Atavian has a long scar running down one side of his face, ending in a [[bionic]] eye.{{Fn|2a}}

