Maximus Epathus.wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Maximus Epathus''' was a [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Chapter]]'s [[6th Company (Ultramarines)|6th Company]] and [[Master of the Rites]] prior to his death.{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|4b}} 


==Biography==
During the [[Siege of the Fenris System]] Epathus led the 6th Company as part of a crusade led by [[Asmodai]] and the [[Dark Angels]]. After arriving to Fenris, Epathus and [[Terrek]] of the [[Iron Hands]] set out for [[Frostheim]], and en route attended a briefing led by Elezar of the [[Dark Angels]].{{Fn|2}}

During the [[Bloodborn]]'s [[Invasion of Ultramar]] Epathus led the 6th Company on the planet [[Quintarn]] in its defence alongside the [[5th Company (Ultramarines)|5th Company]], [[Chronus]], [[Cassius]], [[Telion]] and some of his scouts.{{Fn|5}}

Sometime after the [[Great Rift]]'s creation, Epathus underwent the [[Rubicon Primaris|operation]] needed to be converted into a [[Primaris Space Marine]]. The Captain understood well the value of displaying unquestionable martial might and went to battle in the masterwork [[Armour Gloriastus]].{{Fn|1}} He has led an Ultramarines strike force during the [[Charadon Campaign]].{{Fn|3}}

During the [[Battle of Garrovire]], Epathus was killed by a possessed member of the 6th Company.{{Fn|4b}}

==Wargear==
Epathus wore the [[Armour Gloriastus]], a masterwork suit of [[Gravis Armour|Mark X Gravis armor]].{{Fn|1}}

His main weapons were a pair of [[boltstorm gauntlets]]{{Fn|1}} and an exquisite [[Thunder Hammer]] crafted by the master artificers of [[Iax]].{{Fn|4a}}

