Maximus Karania.wikitext:
{{ChaosTitansPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Princeps]] of the [[Legio Tempestus]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==Overview==
While Legio master [[Indias Cavalerio]] ruled the Tempestus from [[Mars]], Princeps Karania oversaw the Legion's [[Titan]]s deployed in the [[Expeditionary Fleet]]s of the [[Great Crusade]]. Karania was secretly a practitioner of an ancient machine cult known as the Teleologicalica which was popular on the [[Forge World]] of [[Estaban III]], and his loyalities to that world soon eclipsed that of Cavalerio and the [[Emperor]]. After Cavalerio was killed in the [[Schism of Mars]], Karania became the acting head of the Legion and named Estaban III as their new rallying point. However his treachery and support for Traitors cause soon became apparent, and few heeded the call. Karania went on to lead the traitor element of the Tempestus.{{Fn|1}}

After the Heresy, Karania devoted himself to hunting down loyalist elements of his own Legio as well as battle his old foe, the [[Legio Mortis]].{{Fn|2}}

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[The Horus Heresy Book Four - Conquest]], pgs. 138–141
*{{Endn|2}}: [[Adeptus Titanicus: Traitor Legios]], pgs. 18-20

