Maxterius Fae.wikitext:
{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Maxterius Fae''' is the current [[Noble House|Noble Lord]] of [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s [[House Ko'iron]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
In 979.[[M41]], Fae felt he had failed [[House Ko'iron]] in their faith in the [[Redemption Cult]]. To rectify this, the Noble Lord committed an unpredicted act of contrition, by offering himself to [[House Cawdor]]'s [[Redemptor Priest]]s for his failings. [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]]'s other [[Noble House]]s then watched on in horror, as Fae was ritually scarred with the icons of the Redemption's faith. When the Redemptor Priests were done, the Lord of Ko'iron was renewed, as one of the Cult's true faithful, and reclaimed the leadership of his Noble House once more.{{Fn|1}} 

