Maylon Idar III.wikitext:
{{ChaosPortal}}
'''Maylon Idar III''' was a [[Traitor General|Tyrant-General]], who once served in the [[Imperial Army]] before he joined the forces of [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]], during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
By 013.[[M31]] he had command of the world [[Ydursk]], as well as the large [[Traitor Guard|Traitor]] [[Imperial Army]] forces that defended it. That year, however, Ydursk was stealthily invaded by a small contingent of the [[Raven Guard]], who began attacking Idar's forces. They in fact served in the [[Dark Angels]]' [[Passage of the Angels|campaign of vengeance]], which had begun striking back at the [[Traitor]]s who had betrayed the [[Imperium]]. Despite his overwhelming numerical superiority, the [[Traitor General|Tyrant-General]]'s Army was dismantled piece by piece and they were unable to discover who was attacking them. This led Idar to consolidate his forces and then broadcasted a call to parlay with an emissary from his unseen foes. The Raven Guard replied instead with a single mass-reactive round, which put an end to the Tyrant-General's reign on Ydursk.{{Fn|1}} 

==Sources==
*{{Endn|1}}: [[White Dwarf 478]], pg. 108 — ''Horus Heresy: The Passage of the Angel of Death - Ydursk Incident''  

