'''Mazik the Unfixed''' is a warlord of the [[Alpha Legion]].{{Fn|1a}}

Originally an [[Apothecary]], he was fascinated by the attempts of the [[Primarch]] [[Corvus Corax]] to improve the [[Gene-seed|gene-seed]] of the [[Space Marine|Space Marines]] of the [[Raven Guard]]. He created a twisting, labyrinthine base on an unnamed world, conducting experiments including the creation of [[mutant]]s known as the [[Geld]]. He wished to ultimately obtain samples of Space Marine gene-seed and combine them with his own to create [[Chaos Space Marine|Chaos Marines]] in his own image.

Mazik was killed by [[Space Marine Captain|Shadow Captain]] [[Qeld]] of the Raven Guard and Captain [[Mordren]] of the [[Knights of the Raven]] [[Chapter]]s.{{Fn|1b}}

