{{Trivia}}
McCready may be a nod to [[Wikipedia:R.J. MacReady|R.J. MacReady]], the protagonist of the 1982 John Carpenter film ''[[Wikipedia:The Thing (1982 film)|The Thing]]'', which featured a shapeshifting alien being that tried to infiltrate the crew of an Antarctic research outpost (notably MacReady kills the alien with a flamethrower, similarly to the test subject here).

