Meliniel.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Autarch]] of [[Biel-Tan]] and twin to the [[Farseer]] [[Lathriel]]. 

==History==
During the [[Battle of Biel-tan|fracturing of Biel-Tan]], he led the defences of the [[Craftworld]] against [[Chaos]] [[Daemon]]s.{{Fn|1a}} At first he had a sharply negative attitude towards the [[Ynnari]],{{Fn|1b}} but later recognized the need to cooperate with them, & was fully converted to their cause.{{Fn|1с}} 

Meliniel became grand strategist of the Ynnari, leading their combined forces in numerous battles as befit an Autarch of his stature, along with his Lieutenant, the surprisingly loyal [[Drukhari]] ex-[[Dracon]] Azkahr {{Fn|2a}}. He coordinated the Ynnari defence after their betrayal by the [[Genestealer Cult|genestealer]]-corrupted Eldar of the lost [[Craftworld]] of [[Zaisuthra]].{{Fn|2b}}

When the Ynnari made it to the fabled Gate of Malice at the heart of Zaisuthra, Meliniel was the only living Eldar other than [[Yvraine]] to resist the all-consuming blood lust of the Warshard of Khaine, which made the rest of the Eldar descend into a kinslaying murderous rage. He stood alone against the Warshard, most powerful of the [[Avatar of Khaine|Avatars of Khaine]], until with help from [[Iyanna Arienal]], the [[Yncarne]], & [[Althenian]], the monster was defeated. The Ynnari discovered [[The Heart of Eldanesh]] in the tomb of [[Eldanesh]] guarded by the avatar, & Meliniel merged with the powerful gemstone, turning into ''Meliniel Pureheart, Avenger of Eldanesh'', now being able to transform into the primal Avatar of Khaine at will.{{Fn|2c}}

Later during the battle on [[Agarimethea]], Meliniel willingly summons the power of the Warshard to battle a [[Keeper of Secrets]].{{Fn|3}}

==Wargear==
Meliniel wears the armour of an Autarch, painted red in the colours of the Ynnari, & wields ''Ahz-ashir'', known as the striking bolt, an heirloom [[Powered weapon|power spear]] from Biel-tan.{{Fn|2a}}

