Mephidast.wikitext:
{{NurglePortal}}
[[Image:Mephidast.jpg|thumb|right|Mephidast the Plaguereaver{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Mephidast''', also known as '''Mephidast the Plaguereaver''' is a [[Daemon Prince]] of [[Nurgle]]. He is known as the artisan of a thousand plagues and commands a mighty warhost of frenzied [[Daemon]]s, [[Plague Marines]], and [[Cultist]]s.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
According to legend, Mephidast was born of mortal flesh centuries ago.  The man that would become Mephidast became obsessed with mutilation and disease and ironically became an [[Adept]] of the [[Officio Medicae]].  Mutilated corpses and mass-poisonings became ever-frequent.  Finally caught by the local authorities, he was locked away in a dark dungeon and slowly began to lose his sanity from the isolation.  Beginning to scrawl on the walls of shapes and glyphs that simply came from his "imagination", he eventually began to understand these markings were not from his own mind but were a calling from a higher power.  As his devotion to these messages increased his body grew despite his malnourishment.  Over time, the influence of corruptive nature rotted away the bars of his cell.  Escaping from his prison, he unleashed a rampage of [[Warp]]-empowered biological warfare that overwhelmed local Medicae authorities.  Eventually, the entire world died under plague and illness.  His [[Nurgle|patron]] satisfied, Mephidast gained the Plague God's favor, became a [[Champion of Chaos]], and was able to leave the dead world.  He went on an unholy journey to spread the will of Nurgle.{{Fn|1}}

On his journey, Mephidast had no need for conquest, spreading the influence of Nurgle through disease is his only goal.  He has nurtured mass infestations of [[Zombie Plague]] in [[Hive]] cities and created [[Blight Grenade]]s from the infected remains of [[Ministorum]] officials.  Journeying within the [[Warp Storm]] known as the [[Hadex Anomaly]], Mephidast led a horde of Nurgle acolytes and [[Daemon]]s against a [[Khornate]] warband.  Emerging victorious and claiming the [[Daemon World]] for [[Nurgle]], this proved to be his final step in his ascension.  Nurgle elevated Mephidast to [[Daemonhood]] and the conquered world became his domain. Now immortal, Mephidast has begun to turn his wrath on the Imperium and has become a chief enemy in the [[Achilus Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

{{PAGENAME}} is also known to have taken part in the [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|2}}

