Meritous Felyx Chass.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Meritous Felyx Chass''' is the son of the [[Noble|noblewoman]] [[Merity Chass]] and [[Lord Militant General]] [[Ibram Gaunt]], who had a liaison with her during the [[Siege of Vervunhive]].{{Fn|1b}}

Chass is a shy young man with a feminine appearance{{Fn|1b}} and grandson of [[Heymlik Chass]].{{Fn|1a}}

==Tanith First and Only==
He joined the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiment]] as part of the E-Company onboard the ''[[Highness Ser Armaduke]]'', an old [[Tempest Class Frigate]], after he arrived with six new reinforcement companies from [[Verghast]]. This was on the order of his mother to learn from his father, Ibram Gaunt. Gaunt, who didn't know that he had a son, tried to keep him distanced so that his son's presence wouldn't impede him in his duty as the commander of the regiment and also so that no allegations of favouritism arose. As of the day he joined the regiment he was only 11 standard years old but was aged with the help of [[bio-maturation]].{{Fn|1b}} He is always accompanied by '''Maddalena Darebeloved''', his lifeguard.{{Fn|1b}}   

