Merrat Gavallan.wikitext:
{{GreyKnightsPortal}}
'''Merrat Gavallan''' was a [[Space Marine]] of the [[Grey Knights]] [[Chapter]]. He was the former [[Brotherhood Champion]] and [[Castellan]] of the [[Purifier]]s and the '''Warden of the Blade''' — keeper of the cursed [[Blade of Antwyr]].{{Fn|1a}}

Commanding a group of [[Purifiers]] including the young [[Garran Crowe]] to [[Sandava II]] to combat a [[Daemon]]ic outbreak, during the fighting Gavallan was confronted by the [[Keeper of Secrets]] [[Mnay'salath]]. Weakened by years of resisting the Blade of Antwyr, the [[Greater Daemon]] was able to trick Gavallan into releasing the blade which was then used to possess [[Governor]] [[Otto Glas]]. Glas then killed Gavallan with his own Blade.{{Fn|1b}} On his death, [[Garran Crowe]] took up his position.{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}

