Meshol.wikitext:
{{BloodAngelsPortal}}
'''Meshol''' was a member of the [[Blood Angels]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who took part in the [[Horus Heresy]]'s [[Siege of Terra]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
When the [[Emperor]] led a [[Teleportation]] attack on [[Warmaster]] [[Horus]]' flagship, the [[Vengeful Spirit]],{{Fn|2}} he was among the [[Blood Angels]] [[Space Marine Company|Company]] that their [[Primarch]] [[Sanguinius]] commanded. But due to Horus' machinations, the strike force's teleportation separated them all and the Blood Angels found themselves alone aboard the flagship. This did not stop them from carrying out the Emperor's attack and they fought the [[Sons of Horus]] repeatedly, as Sanguinius led his Company deeper into the Vengeful Spirit.{{Fn|1}}   

