Methkar.wikitext:
{{WordBearersPortal}}
'''Methkar''' was a [[Word Bearers|Word Bearer]] who served during the [[Horus Heresy]].{{Fn|1}}

He was part of the [[Chaos|Traitor]] guerrilla forces that fought beneath the surface of [[Calth]] in the [[Underworld War]]. Serving under the [[Dark Apostle]] [[Kurtha Sedd]] of the [[Third Hand]], Methkar was part of Sedd's force that attacked a section of subterranean tunnel garrisoned by [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Vultius]] and his men. Although Sedd and his disciples were able to subdue the defenders and take them prisoner, two [[Imperial]]s ([[Aeonid Thiel|Thiel]] and [[Rowd]]) escaped and to the surface. The two eventually infiltrated the tunnels and effected a rescue; Methkar was killed by Thiel, who had disguised himself as one of the Word Bearers.{{Fn|1}}

