Midael (Sergeant).wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''Midael''' is a [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] in the [[Dark Angels]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1b}}
==History==
He was among its forces that [[Space Marine Captain|Master]] [[Tigraine]] led to aid [[Tarnis]], which was soon going to be invaded by the [[Ork]] [[Waaagh!]] of [[Warboss]] [[Nekkruncha]]{{Fn|1b}}. The [[Imperial]] world was also ruled by the [[Knights]] of [[House Drakkus]], who had a pact of alliance with the [[Dark Angels]]. However when Tigraine's strike force reached Tarnis, they received a plea for aid from the [[Knight House]] stating it was under attack. A [[Khorne]] [[Chaos Warband|Warband]] had suddenly overwhelmed Drakkus' fortress, '''Fort Drakkus''', and while the Dark Angels forced the Warband to retreat, only a single Knight had survived the invasion{{Fn|1a}}. Tigraine chose Midael to act as an envoy to the Knight, who vowed to uphold the pact his House had made with the Dark Angels. Taking the mantle of the [[Freeblade]] [[Vortigan]], he soon began aiding Tigraine's strike force in saving his now beleaguered [[Homeworld]], from Nekkruncha's Orks{{Fn|1b}} and the Khorne Warband.{{Fn|1c}}  

