'''Mikelus''' was a [[Blood Ravens]] [[Reclusiarch]] who served under [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Davian Thule]] during the [[Kronus]] Campaign.{{Fn|1}}

==History==
During the final battle against the [[Necrons]] beneath the Thur'abis Plateau, Mikelus fought alongside Thule, where he was killed by the [[Necron Lord]].  Thule officially credited Mikelus with defeating the Necron Lord, even though Mikelus had already perished when Thule himself defeated it.{{Fn|2}}

==Relics==
The ''Blessing of Mikelus'' is a [[Purity Seal]] that reads "Walk Ever Forward in the Light of the Emperor, Blood Ravens."{{Fn|2}}

==Background==
Mikelus appears in [[Dawn of War: Dark Crusade]] as an [[Honour Guard]] unit, though he has the same stats as a regular Chaplain.{{Fn|1}}

His death and subsequent honouring are described in a conversation between Sergeants [[Tarkus]], [[Cyrus]], and [[Avitus]], who are discussing how Captain Thule lost his right eye.{{Fn|2}}


