In 471.[[M40]], he answered a plea from the [[Departmento Colonia]], to check on the status of the [[Imperial]] colony [[Ereus V]]. It had been silent for twenty years and Milonus sent two squadrons to discover the fate of the world's colonists. One of the squadrons was led by [[Space Marine Sergeant|Sergeant]] [[Basileus]], whose squad member [[Lorenz]] complained about their mission. He felt it was beneath them and that they should be fighting a war instead. Another squad member named [[Dante]] refuted this, but a grumbling Lorenz stated Milonus should be more selective about which requests for aid the [[Blood Angels]] answered.{{Fn|1}}

