The Warlord nearly defeated the [[Astra Militarum]] when his horde charged through the no man's land separating the two forces and broke through the Militarum's infantry lines. However, Tesla immediately counter-attacked with a Jouran Tank Company and forced the [[Orks]] back to their lines. The Colonel then led a charge after the Orks and, together with supporting infantry, destroyed hundreds of Grashtak's warbands. Tesla's attack broke open the Vasterloir Salient and paved the way for victory in the campaign against the Warlord's horde.{{Fn|1}}

