Miyamoto de Bergerac.wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Miyamoto de Bergerac''' was [[Commissar]] [[Ciaphas Cain]]'s fencing tutor at the [[Schola Progenium]].{{Fn|1}}

Combat training was one of the few subjects in which Cain's schola results were above average{{Fn|2}}, and [[Amberley Vail]] testified on numerous occasions that Cain was one of the finest swordsmen she ever encountered, which she attributed to a mix of his training from Bergerac, diligent practice, and combat experience.{{Fn|3}}

In moments of stress, Cain would sometimes wield his [[chainsword]] with a lack of finesse that would lead him to ruefully imagine Bergerac's reaction.{{Fn|1}}


