Moirelle.wikitext:
{{AdeptaSororitasPortal}}
'''Moirelle''' is a [[Canoness Preceptor]] in the [[Order of Our Martyred Lady]].{{Fn|1}} 
==History==
In [[M42]], she was sent by her [[Order of Our Martyred Lady|Order]] to end a series of insurrections on [[Varentis II]]. However the tides of the [[Warp]] were against her fleet and they arrived at the world a year later. By then Varentis' insurrections had revealed themselves to be the workings of [[Chaos Cult]]s, which now had control of the world. Unbowed by this, Moirelle quickly [[War for Varentis II|invaded]] Varentis II with 4 of the Martyred Lady's [[Adepta Sororitas]] Commanderies. With the aid of her second in command [[Canoness]] [[Yves-Io]], along with [[Palatine (Adepta Sororitas)|Palatine]] [[Theria]] and a surviving [[Loyalist]] militia, led by [[Bishop-Praetor]] [[Inigo Ravellon]], Moirelle succeeded in defeating the [[Heretics]].{{Fn|1}} 

