Morbun Xa.wikitext:
{{WhiteScarsPortal}}
'''Morbun Xa''' was a member of the [[White Scars]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], who took part in the [[Great Crusade]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
As an [[Aspirant]], he was famed, not just for his prowess, but also for his restraint. Xa was considered a model of the White Scars' [[Path of Heaven]] and he was given a recently constructed [[Powerblade]] to wield, when he became a full member of the Legion. The White Scars' blademasters believed Xa had the suitable character to wield the blade and he took it with him when he left [[Chogoris]] as part of the [[Brotherhood of the Night's Star]].{{Fn|1}}

His journey in the [[Great Crusade]] began aboard the warship ''[[Korghaz]]'', which later took the Brotherhood to [[Egetha IX]]. It was there that Xa first drew the blade against an enemy and his Brotherhood would defeat their foes.{{Fn|1}}

He would fight on other battlefields, but Xa eventually died during the Great Crusade. His blade was recovered, however, and would be passed on to another [[Battle Brother]]. This Battle Brother too would die in the Great Crusade and Powerblade was then given to [[Ajak Khan]].{{Fn|1}}

