Morbus featured prominently in the [[Orphean War#The Battle of Amarah|Battle of Amarah]], fighting almost continuously for three weeks of sustained, heavy combat before the Minotaurs' fighting withdrawal from the surface of [[Amarah Prime]].  He later prevented the rout of the Imperial forces at [[Callowsheen Hive]], personally accounting for the destruction of several [[Triarch Stalker]]s at close quarters.{{Fn|1}}

