Morias Leuze.wikitext:
{{AdeptusMechanicusPortal}}
[[Image:LeuzeSM2.jpg|thumb|right|250px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|1d}}]]
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Tech-Priest]] of the [[Adeptus Mechanicus]].{{Fn|1a}}

Leuze was a Mechanicus [[Magos]] who's research specialized in that of the [[Immaterium]]. He was the principal [[Artisan]] on [[Project Aurora]] under [[Archmagos]] [[Nozick Beta-12]], to whom Magos Leuze was an apprentice. Leuze considered the reconstruction of [[Project Aurora]] his life's work and intended to use its [[Warp]] nullification powers of [[Blackstone]] to combat the dangers of [[Chaos]].{{Fn|1b}} He was the only survivor of Nozick's team on [[Avarax]], the rest being killed by [[Tyranid]]s.{{Fn|1a}} 

After being rescued from the Tyranids by [[Demetrian Titus]] and his squad, the [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Lieutenant|Lieutenant]] is horrified at the discovery that the Mechanicum has rebuilt Aurora and intends to use it to fight the forces of Chaos.{{Fn|1b}} Leuze refuses to back down from his plan, protected by an energy shield as Titus and his squad attempt to kill him with [[Bolter]] fire. Leuze seemingly forces back [[Imurah]] and his [[Thousand Sons]], but this is revealed to have been a ruse by the [[Sorcerer]] to allow Leuze to complete his work on Aurora. Once he had completed his plans with Aurora, Leuze is killed by Imurah, who sought to use the [[Xenos]] device to amplify the power of the Warp.{{Fn|1d}}

