{{AstraMilitarumPortal}}
'''Morl "Razor" Rachnor''' is a [[Catachan]] [[General]] who was being transported by a [[Battlefleet]], that became lost within the [[Imperium Nihilus]] due to the [[Great Rift]].{{Fn|1}}

