Morn (Imperial).wikitext:
{{ImperiumPortal}}
'''Morn, the Matriarch of War,''' was an [[Imperial]] front-line high commander of the [[Great Crusade]], who served on its [[War Council]].{{fn|1}} 
==History==
She was present when the rediscovered [[Primarch]] [[Lion El'Jonson]] joined the [[War Council]], just as the [[Great Crusade|Crusade]] entered a new phase that marked its maturity and relentless momentum. At that time, the Council was convening in the [[Sol System]], aboard the [[Phalanx]] of the [[Imperial Fists]] [[Space Marine Legion]]. To mark this great occasion's place in the Crusade's history, the meeting would later become known as the '''First Solar Conclave'''.{{fn|1}}

During the [[Horus Heresy]], she accompanied [[Sigismund]] and [[Fafnir Rann]] in the earliest phases of the [[Solar War]]. During a mission against the [[Word Bearers]] on a comet, she played an active combat role clad in her exoskeleton and armed with her dual [[Volkite Serpenta]] pistols.{{fn|2}}
==Notes==
The [[Sigismund: The Eternal Crusader (Novel)]] does not mention what organization Morn belongs to.{{fn|1}}
