Morn Graevarr.wikitext:
{{SpaceMarinePortal}}
'''Morn Graevarr''' is a [[Sons of Medusa]] [[Iron Thane]], who commands the [[Chapter]]'s [[Atropos War Clan]].{{Fn|1}} 

He was among the [[Sons of Medusa]]'s forces that took part in the [[Badab War]], but was gravely wounded there and lost his left arm. Graevarr survived the campaign, though, and received a [[bionic]] arm to make him whole again. When his [[Chapter]] gained the ability to create [[Primaris Space Marines]] in [[M42]], Graevarr decided to undergo the [[Rubicon Primaris]] to become one himself. He would go on to become the leader of the [[Atropos War Clan]] and the [[Iron Thane]] now ventures out on a crusade amongst the stars, seeking out traitors and [[heretic]]s.{{Fn|1}}

