{{NecromundaPortal}}
'''Morrow Orienus Orlock''' is the current lord of [[House Orlock]] on [[Necromunda (planet)|Necromunda]].{{Fn|1}}{{Fn|2}}


==Biography==
An enigmatic figure, Lord Morrow was badly scarred in his youth when his [[Ash-runner]] was forced off the road during a convoy mission. Dragging himself from the wreckage covered in burning [[promethium]], Morrow is said to have leapt onto his rival's rig and, still alight, unloaded his guns into the vehicle's cab. These days, Morrow seldom leaves his workshop beneath the Lucky Six, and when he must attend clan gatherings in [[Hive Primus]], he does so concealed under a heavy stormcoat and ash rider mask.{{Fn|1}} In most respects the members of the House are bound to follow the will of its largest extended family.{{Fn|2}}

