Mortifax.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
'''Mortifax''' was a [[Space Marine]] who served in the [[Deathwatch]] as a [[Deathwatch Black Shield|Black Shield]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
He was originally from the [[Sons of Medusa]] [[Chapter]], and was known as '''Kaspar Dabanville'''. At some point he was called on to serve in the Deathwatch.{{Fn|1}}

Over the course of 106 years of service with the Deathwatch, Dabanville developed a particular hatred for the [[Aeldari]]. This led him on a number of missions to scour entire [[Eldar World|worlds]] of the [[xenos]]. Eventually, he led seven [[Kill-Team]]s to the planet of [[Brand's Gate]], where he planned to enter the Aeldari [[Webway]] and take the fight to the xenos.{{Fn|1}}

However, on penetrating the Webway, the Aeldari sprung their trap and ambushed the Kill-Teams. The Aeldari killed every Astartes save for Dabanville, whom they allowed to live. Returning to Brand's Gate in humiliation, Dabanville took the oath of the Black Shield, changing his name to Mortifax and painting over his [[Space Marine Power Armour|armour]] to eliminate any connection to his old chapter.{{Fn|1}}

==Sources==
