Muon Nol.wikitext:
{{EldarPortal}}
'''Muon Nol''' was a [[Dire Avenger]] of [[Craftworld]] [[Dolthe]], who served as chief bodyguard to Lord [[Eon Kull]].{{Fn|1}}


==Biography==
While the [[Sabbat Worlds Crusade]] raged, Eon Kull led a force of [[Eldar]] on the planet [[Monthax]] to close a [[Webway Portal]] that led to Dolthe, in order to protect the Craftworld from the hordes of [[Chaos Cultists]] fighting against the Crusade.{{Fn|1}}

When the cultists attacked the Eldar's positions, Muon received unexpected help - [[Guardsmen]] of the [[Tanith First and Only]] [[Imperial Guard Platoon|Third Platoon]], led by [[Major]] [[Elim Rawne]]; as part of Eon Kull's defences he had created a series of psychic visions which led to the guardsmen believing that they were defending [[Tanith|their homeworld]]. Similarly, they believed that Muon Nol was the Tanith officer '''Colonel Munnol'''. Although the deception was revealed, the [[Imperial]]s still ended up helping the Eldar, with [[Inquisitor]] [[Lilith Abfequarn]] helping to close the portal after Eon Kull died.{{Fn|1}} 

==Wargear==
Muon Nol wielded the [[Shrieker Cannon|shrieker cannon]] ''[[Uliowye]]'', presented to him on Monthax by Eon Kull.{{Fn|1}}

