Mycelite.wikitext:
{{DeathGuardPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a [[Death Guard]] [[Sorcerer]].{{Fn|1a}}

Mycelite's true name and history are not known, having chosen his present name in the [[Garden of Nurgle]] after living there for a long period. While in the Garden, he claims to have stood at the feet of the caged [[Isha]] and listened to her weeping.{{Fn|1b}}

Mycelite eventually comandeered the former [[Space Wolf]] vessel ''[[Frostaxe]]'', which became the core of the [[Space Hulk]] ''[[Festerax]]''. He intended to use the Hulk to reap a campaign of destruction, culminating at the [[Hive World]] of [[Kefa Primaris]].{{Fn|1a}} To that end, he used [[Baldr]], a captured [[Space Wolves]] [[Psyker]] and member of [[Járnhamar Pack]], in a bid to slave his psyche to the ''Frostaxe'' and use it to control the wider Hulk.{{Fn|1c}} However, due to the intervention of the rest of Járnhamar Pack and [[Njal Stormcaller]], Baldr was able to break free and use his immense psychic power to destroy Mycelite.{{Fn|1d}}

