{{ImperiumPortal}}
[[Image:Myron Jubalgunn.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Myron Jubalgunn and his unknown [[Xenos|Xeno]] partner.{{Fn|1}}]]
'''Myron Jubalgunn''' is an [[Imperial]] renegade and criminal, who is being pursued by the [[Inquisitor]] [[Toulon Hess]].{{Fn|1}}
==History==
He is currently on [[Logans World]], along with his unknown [[Xenos|Xeno]] partner. While it is normally surrounded by a [[Warp Storm]], the two managed to land on the world during a brief storm break. [[Inquisitor]] Hess has also reached Logans World, though, and has now warned its population to be on the look out for the dangerous criminal and Xeno. He has warned, however, that anyone who withholds information about their whereabouts, will suffer the wrath of the [[Emperor]].{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
{{trivia}}
Myron Jubalgunn is possibly a [[Sensei]] - as the same image of him was also used as an example of a Sensei in [[Realm of Chaos: The Lost and the Damned]].{{Fn|2}}

