Nakir.wikitext:
{{DarkAngelsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''', the '''Master of Souls''', is the [[Dark Angels Grand Master|Grand Master]] of the [[Consecrators]] [[Chapter]]. Considered an enigma by the rest of the [[Unforgiven]], he spends much of his time in the catacombs of his flagship, the ''[[Reliquaria]]''.{{Fn|1a}}


==Biography==
Nakir was an [[Interrogator-Chaplain]] of the Consecrators before he ascended to become Grand Master of the Chapter, earning six [[black pearl]]s.{{Fn|1a}} Leading a Chapter known to send missions into the ruins of [[Caliban]] in search of relics of the Dark Angels Legion, he is believed to know more about its history than even [[Ezekiel]].{{Fn|1b}}

Nakir recovered the ''[[Sword of Sanctity]]'', the lost [[Heavenfall Blades|Heavenfall Blade]] of Grand Master [[Orias (Dark Angel)|Orias]], presenting it to Supreme Grand Master [[Azrael]] of the [[Dark Angels]] two decades later when he answered summons to the site of destroyed Caliban. Azrael bade him keep the sword by right of recovery. In the battle that followed against the [[Chaos Space Marine]] forces led by [[Typhus]], Nakir was given command of [[the Rock]] while Azrael assaulted the ''[[Terminus Est]]''.{{Fn|1b}}

During the [[Arks of Omen Campaign]], Nakir led his Chapter alongside a massive [[Unforgiven]] armada in the [[Battle of Idolatros]]. During the battle, Nakir was placed by Azrael in command of The Rock and its accompanying armada while the Dark Angels high command boarded [[Wyrmwood (Caliban)|Wyrmwood]].{{Fn|2}}

