Narbo.wikitext:
Governor '''Narbo''' was the [[Imperial Commander]] of [[Sepus Prime]] in the [[Western Reaches]] of [[Segmentum Pacificus]]. He fell to [[Chaos]], led an insurrection against the [[Imperium]], and during this war turned into a [[Chaos Spawn]], which was killed by [[Sanctioned Psyker]] [[Glutt]].{{Fn|1}}

==History==
Narbo was planetary governor of [[Sepus Prime]]. He turned to [[Chaos]] and united the warring factions of insurrectionists into an army by executing anyone who opposed him. Despite attempts to stop him by the [[Imperial Guard]], his insurrectionist army took the planet, but his inner circle was infiltrated by [[Gorny]], his personal pilot, who was planted by Lieutenant [[Sorov]]. When the Imperial Guard attempted a final push to take the civitate, Narbo's insurrectionists pinned down the force led by Sergeant [[Kapek]] at Tadmor Ridge.{{Fn|1}}

Narbo set off in his personal [[Aquila Lander]] shuttle to deal with Kapek's troops, but Gorny sent co-ordinates of his flight route to Sorov. Sorov moved his unit into position, and used a [[Rocket Launcher]] to down the shuttle. Narbo survived, but transformed into a [[Chaos Spawn]]. After killing several of Sorov's troops, the Spawn was killed by [[Sanctioned Psyker]] [[Glutt]], shortly before the entire planet was destroyed by [[Virus Bomb]]s.{{Fn|1}}

