'''Nash''' was a [[General]] of the [[Astra Militarum]], who commanded the [[Roane Deepers]] [[Imperial Guard Regiment|regiments]] committed to the [[Siege of Vervunhive]].{{Fn|1a}}

Nash served in Guard infantry for most of his life, rising up through the ranks and becoming respected by his men for his leadership skills. He was a key Guard commander during the Siege of Vervunhive, but met his end in the Third [[Zoica]]n Storm of [[Vervunhive|the hive]], dying to multiple gunshot wounds as he led the desperate defence of the [[Ontabi Gate]].{{Fn|1b}}

