Nashir Sahansun.wikitext:
{{InquisitionPortal}}
'''Nashir Sahansun''' is an [[Inquisitor]] who created the [[Octarius Sector]]'s [[Cordon Impenetra]], which surrounds the on-going [[Octarius War]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
By the time of the Octarius War Sahansun was elderly and kept alive through extensive bionic and rejuvenate treatments. However he had once been a young and aggressive Inquisitor known as a scrapper and brawler who fought on the frontlines alongside his agents. His methods proved effective at building a great many allies from [[Imperial Guard]] [[General]]s to [[Imperial Navy]] [[Admiral]]s to even [[Space Marine]] [[Chapter]]s. In his later life he was badly wounded by [[Hrud]] and took several years to recover.{{Fn|2}}

Unlike many other [[Imperial]] observers, Nashir believed the [[Xenos]] conflict in the Octarius Sector would spill into nearby Imperium [[System]]s. In order to prevent that from happening, the [[Inquisitor]] devised plans to create the [[Cordon Impenetra]], which encircled the outer areas where the [[Octarius War]] was being fought. Nashir declared those Imperial worlds within the circle to be lost and then pushed hard for every [[Sub-sector]] bordering the Cordon Impenetra to fortified and reinforced.{{Fn|1}}   

Sahansun continued to command authority during the Octarius war, but due to the selfish behavior of [[Fabricator-General]] [[Einrekh Phlagustok]] is considering abandoning [[Sigma-Ulstari]].{{Fn|3}}

==Notes==
Their name is spelled '''Nasir''' in the [[10th Edition]] Tyranid codex.{{Fn|4}}

