Initially, her unit was tasked with guarding outpost [[D-16 West]] in the wastelands of [[Armageddon Secundus]].{{Fn|1a}} After [[Reclusiarch]] [[Merek Grimaldus|Grimaldus]] uncovered the existence of the [[Ordinatus Armageddon]] beneath the outpost, however, the Storm Troopers were redeployed to [[Hive Helsreach]] to assist in the [[Helsreach Crusade|defence]] of the city.{{Fn|1b}}

