Nathadian Desh.wikitext:
{{AdeptusCustodesPortal}}
'''Nathadian Desh''' is an [[Adeptus Custodes]] [[Shield-Captain]] of the [[Dread Host]], who wears black upon his [[power armor]] as a mark of shame.{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
His [[Shield Company]] follows suit for the same reason, which comes from the [[Adeptus Custodes]]' inability to protect [[Emperor of Mankind|the Emperor]] during the [[Siege of Terra]]. As a result of this strong feeling of shame, Desh leads the Company in a never-ending [[Crusade]] for redemption, as an act of penance for the Custodes' failures. The Shield Company truly believes only the destruction of the Emperor's enemies can wash away the ancient stench of failure and defeat. So far during the course of their Crusade, Desh has notably destroyed a [[Cerastus Knight]] and has caused an entire mob of charging [[Ork]] [[Boyz]] to flee from him.{{Fn|1}}

==Trivia==
