Navarra.wikitext:
{{ImperialFistsPortal}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' was a member of the [[Imperial Fists]] during the [[Great Crusade]] and [[Horus Heresy]].{{fn|2a}}

{{spoiler|source=Crimson Fist (Novella)}}
A legionary of the 6th company, he was part of the force accompanied captain [[Amandus Tyr]] to try to execute [[Perturabo]] on his flag ship ''[[Iron Blood]]'' amidst the [[Battle at the Phall System]].{{Fn|1a}} After entering the throne chamber of the [[Primarch]], the entire attack force was destroyed but Navarra still had life in him.{{Fn|1b}}

{{spoiler|source=Angel Exterminatus (Novel)}}
He was subsequently given as a gift to the III Legion{{fn|2b}} and in turn was delivered to [[Fabius]]{{fn|2c}} who turned him into a [[Enhanced Warrior|hideous beast]] with no trace of his original self, except for the bits kept in check by [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Felix Cassander]]{{fn|2d}}. Ultimately, he and Cassander managed to destroy most of Fabius's laboratory, along with all of his genetic samples except one, and thus met their deaths.{{Fn|2e}}

