Nehalen.wikitext:
{{AlphaLegionPortal}}
'''Ancient Nehalen''', also known as '''the Interitus''', was a [[Contemptor Dreadnought]] of the [[Alpha Legion]] and a member of the personal bodyguard cadre of [[Autilon Skorr]]. He took part in the [[Battle for Mezoa]].{{Fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[File:Nehalen.jpg|thumb|right|275px|Ancient Nehalen{{Fn|1}}]]
Nehalen was renowned among the [[Alpha Legion]] for his exploits as a member of the [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]]'s [[Destroyer Marine|Destroyer]] cadre and he earned the title ''Interitus'' for his brutal methods. His reputation was such that it is said that the fear of his deployment to a warzone was worth more than a full [[Space Marine Company|company]] of lesser warriors.{{Fn|1}}

Nehalen was severely wounded in battle against the [[Fra'al]] and then interred in a [[Space Marine Dreadnought|Dreadnought]] shell. This meant that he could no longer carry out his specialty, infiltration missions, which made him furious and woke an appetite for open slaughter in him that exceeded that of his fellow legionnaires.{{Fn|1}}

Ancient Nehalen acted as [[Autilon Skorr]]'s bodyguard and enforcer on [[Mezoa]], a role which included delivering many of the suicidal edicts of the Alpha Legion Commander to the [[Iron Warriors]] under his command. Nehalen was finally killed in battle with [[Cassian Dracos]], the [[Dragon Revenant]], a fight which levelled an entire sub-section of the Mezoan [[Forge-fane]].{{Fn|1}}

