Nerat Kirine.wikitext:
{{RavenGuardPortal}}
'''Nerat Kirine''' was the [[Praetor (Rank)|Shade Captain]] of the 18th Chapter of the [[Raven Guard]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], the [[Ashen Claws]], during the [[Great Crusade]]. Exiled by [[Corax]], his Chapter returned to the [[Imperium]] to raid the [[Nostramo Sector]] during the [[Horus Heresy]] before disappearing into the [[Ghoul Stars]] again.{{fn|1}}

==Biography==
[[Image:NeratKirine.jpg|thumb|right|200px|{{PAGENAME}}{{Fn|3}}]]
Born on [[Terra]], '''Nerat Kirine''' was among the Xeric tribesmen who formed the XIXth Legion's early recruits. Brutally efficient at the hit and run tactics favoured by the Legion, he became [[Praetor (Rank)|Shade Captain]] of the 18th Chapter, known as the [[Ashen Claws]] and devised the strategy utilised in the [[Battle of Hell's Anvil]] that established assignment to the XIXth Legion as a death sentence to [[Imperial Army]] units.{{fn|2}}

After the [[Battle of Gate Forty-Two]] in 002.[[M31]], he and the survivors of his Chapter were sent into the [[Ghoul Stars]] as part of a nomad predation fleet under the command of the [[Deliverance]]-born [[Praetor (Rank)|Praetor]] Calvus. After the outbreak of the [[Horus Heresy]], the Ashen Claws returned from the Ghoul Stars to raid the [[Nostramo Sector]], sacking several of the [[Night Lords]]' strongholds for munitions and war materiel. He was in command of the Ashen Claws at the [[Battle of Desperation]], where he claimed to owe no loyalty to either the [[Emperor]] or the turncoat [[Horus|Warmaster]].{{fn|1}}

==Sources==
