Nergui.wikitext:
{{DeathwatchPortal}}
{{WhiteScarsPortal}}
'''Nergui''' is a [[Watch Captain|Captain]] of the [[Deathwatch]], originally hailing from the [[White Scars]] [[Chapter]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1b}}

Nergui leads '''Watch Company Vigil''', based out of the [[Watch Station]] known as [[Picket's Watch]].{{Fn|1a}}{{Fn|1c}}  In '''999.[[M41]]''', Nergui was part of a Deathwatch strike force sent to destroy [[M'Yan'Ral]], a [[Tau]] [[KV128 Stormsurge|Stormsurge]] production and training facility on the planet [[Proth]].{{Fn|1d}}  

Nergui was also able to call in help from the [[4th Brotherhood (White Scars)|4th Brotherhood]] of the [[White Scars]], led by [[Batbayar Khan]], who were en route from [[Agrellan]] back to [[Chogoris]] to defend it.  However, he was only able to convince the Khan by lying to him; Nergui told Batbayar that the infamous [[Tau Commander]] [[O'Shaserra|Shadowsun]] was present at M'Yan'Ral.  Batbayar agreed, as the death of Shadowsun, who had managed to evade capture and death at the hands of [[Kor'sarro Khan]], the chapter's [[Master of the Hunt]], would earn him glory.{{Fn|1e}}

==Wargear==
As is typical of the [[White Scars]], Nergui prefers to ride into battle atop his customized [[Space Marine Bike|bike]], ''[[Ganbold]]''.{{Fn|1b}}

