Nero (Horus Heresy).wikitext:
{{UltramarinesPortal}}
'''Nero''' was a high ranking member of the [[Ultramarines]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]], during the [[Horus Heresy]] and was known for being a skilled swordsman.{{fn|1}} 
==History==
Shortly after the [[Emperor's Children]] [[Space Marine Legion|Legion]] fell to [[Slaanesh]], [[Space Marine Captain|Captain]] [[Lucius (Emperor's Children)|Lucius]] made a list of [[Loyalist]]s who would be able to challenge him in combat. Nero was initially among them, but after some further thought, Lucius dismissed the [[Ultramarine]] as being any challenge to him. While Nero could kill with something approaching flair, Lucius noted the Ultramarine also fought with more than a hint of rote in his sword swings.{{fn|1}}

==Sources==
